** femahoy M2 keyword fixture: every keyword of the linear static subset in one model.
** A unit cube of 6 C3D10 elements, x 2..3. The end x = 3 is clamped. Step 1 pulls the end
** x = 2 with a pressure of -10 on an element surface. Step 2 puts the same pressure on the
** same faces with *DLOAD. Poisson's ratio is 0, so the exact solution is uniform tension
** sxx = 10, u_x = -10 (3 - x) / E, u_y = u_z = 0. E = 1000: u_x(2) = -0.01.
